Protocol shapes and behavioral references were researched from the official
anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python project at commit
f93e29cc951cd5fddcaaed9f3c49c3c38dedd6ab and the official Agent SDK overview.
Except for the query algorithm adaptation noted below, no official or competing
SDK implementation or test source is redistributed or linked as a dependency. Source hashes and test provenance are recorded in
docs/compatibility.md. Reference-source licenses do not replace or extend the
license of the CLI or its services; those remain subject to their own terms.

Additional type-organization research: severity1/claude-agent-sdk-go
(d167fbef06759f127f5623bcf685c05b422de5df, MIT) and
Roasbeef/claude-agent-sdk-go (a886b29cee2478f48251cfaab02142683ee43d6b, MIT).
Official TypeScript npm 0.3.302 was used for wire-schema cross-checking only;
it is not MIT. No TypeScript reference implementation source is redistributed.
Detailed source/license review: docs/type-sources.md.

Detached permission/control schemas and AskUserQuestion data were also
cross-checked against those pinned SDK sources and the official
Agent SDK user-input documentation. These are source-reviewed and mock-tested
contracts, not a claim of live CLI interoperability.

Local message-query chain/parallel reconstruction in session_query_chain.go and
metadata title/preview selection in session_metadata.go are
adapted from anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-python, sessions.py, commit
0e89b298e771259378a6cd3734e00d323dff5703 (SDK 0.2.174).

